,"Prevent caches and request continuations from crossing authorization contexts; do not apply legacy handshake assumptions universally."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"MCP-10","source_ids":["MCP-TRANSPORTS","MCP-HTTP"],"sources":["https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2026-07-28/basic/transports","https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2026-07-28/basic/transports/streamable-http"],"status":"runtime_validation_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Apply version-aware metadata, caching, and cancellation","validation":"dynamic"},{"alignment_source_ids":["CIS-MCP-2026","OWASP-AISVS-C9","AIUC1-Q3-2026"],"assurance":"Partial static coverage only; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI027","AI031"],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Place allow/deny decisions at the execution boundary using trusted policy inputs and constrained tool capabilities.","Show that an injected instruction cannot disable policy, choose privileged credentials, or bypass approval."],"finding_ids":["592fbfc9b7dab062dc97906c"],"id":"AGT-01","source_ids":["ASD-HARNESS"],"sources":["https://www.cyber.gov.au/business-government/secure-design/artificial-intelligence/agentic-ai-harnesses"],"status":"findings_detected","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Enforce action policy outside the model","validation":"hybrid"},{"alignment_source_ids":["CSA-SCOPING","OWASP-AISVS-C9"],"assurance":"Partial static coverage only; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI031"],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Present actual recipient, target, arguments, data disclosure, and consequences for high-impact approval.","Invalidate approval if arguments or target change; test races, delayed retries, and approval reuse."],"finding_ids":["592fbfc9b7dab062dc97906c"],"id":"AGT-02","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENT-CS"],"sources":["https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/AI_Agent_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html"],"status":"findings_detected","supp